silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_02_twelve_leg_deep_dive_sections_11_classification_leg_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In 'ClassificationLegYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In 'Classification Leg', the classification_leg_arrow is DomesticCat -> MittensColimitApex: the species-type leg; it is monic but not epic; it does not identify Mittens with the species.; also, In 'Classification Leg', the typing_arrow FelisCatusTSN183798 -> DomesticCat connects the ITIS database entry to the classification type node; preserving both taxonomy and classification legs as distinct arrows with a stated relationship." .
